# Vue 2 Enterprise Page Template Guide

This template provides a standard template for enterprise page development based on the Vue 2 + Composition API, integrating common components and best practices.

## Core component description

### 1. KyTreeTable layout component
- Supports tree sidebars, search areas, table content, and pagination
- Control sidebar display via the 'isShowLeft' property
- Provides the search, table, and page slots

### 2. ECard card assembly
- Used to wrap various functional blocks
- Support type="search" and type="footer"
- Provides uniform card styles and spacing

### 3. CTable table component
- Enterprise form components
- Supports custom column configuration
- Integrated paging, sorting, filtering and other functions
- Table header configuration properties list, table actual data tableData, load, default setting height "92%"
- Table "list" Information about configuration files is as follows:

```js
const tableConfig =[
{
  label:'名称',
  prop:'name',
  slot:'name',// Sockets are used when special styles are included or when more data manipulation is required
  width: 150, // The width is controlled according to the actual display length
  align: 'center', // By default, the content is too long, the first column of content is aligned against it, and the last column is aligned to the right
},
{
  label: "操作",
  fixed: "right", // If the table list exceeds the width limit, fix the last column to the right
  align: "right",
  prop: "operation",
  width: 210,
  slot: 'operation', // 超过三个以上的操作使⽤“'更多'组件EMoreButton”
}
]
```
### 4. EButton button assembly
- Uniform button style
- Supports multiple states and types
- Integrated permission control

## Standard page template
```vue
<template>
  <KyTreeTable
    :isShowLeft="true"
  >
    <!-- 搜索区域 -->
    <ECard
      type="search"
      noneBottom
      slot="search"
    >
      <div class="p-4">
        <!-- 搜索表单内容 -->
        <el-form :model="searchForm" size="mini" inline>
        <el-form-item label="" props="" v-if="showMore"> // 根据实际情况，搜索条件超过一行则隐藏控制后面条件
        <el-input
            v-model="searchForm.['prop']"
            placeholder=""
            style="width: 100%"
            clearable
            @change="onChange(['prop'], $event)"
          />
        </el-form-item>
        <!-- 按钮 -->
        <el-form-item>
          <el-button type="primary" icon="el-icon-search" @click="searchFn">
            查询
          </el-button>
          <el-button icon="el-icon-refresh-right" @click="resetFn">重置</el-button>
          <el-button type="text" style="margin-left: 8px" @click="toggleMore">
            {{ showMore == true ? "收起" : "高级筛选" }}
            <i :class="showMore ? 'el-icon-arrow-up' : 'el-icon-arrow-down'" />
          </el-button>
        </el-form-item>
      </el-form>
      </div>
    </ECard>

    <!-- 表格区域 -->
    <ECard slot="table">
      <div class="mb-4">  // 根据实际条件显示按钮内容，没有则不显示
        <EButton type="primary" @click="handleAdd" class="mr-2">新增</EButton>
        <EButton type="danger" @click="handleBatchDelete">批量删除</EButton>
      </div>
      <CTable
        type="index" // 根据实际需求设置表格是多选表格还是自定义索引的表格（selection/index/expand）
        :tableData="tableData"
        :loading="loading"
        :list="columns"
        @selection-change="handleSelectionChange"
      />
    </ECard>

    <!-- 分页区域 -->
    <ECard
      slot="page"
      type="footer"
    >
    </ECard>

  </KyTreeTable>
</template>

<script>
import {
  ref,
  reactive,
  getCurrentInstance,
  onMounted
} from "vue";
import {
  useQuery,
  useMutation
} from "@tanstack/vue-query";

export default {
  name: 'StandardPage',
  setup() {
    const { proxy } = getCurrentInstance();

    // 表格数据
    const tableData = ref([]);
    const loading = ref(false);
    const columns = ref([
      { type: 'selection', width: 55 },
      { prop: 'name', label: '名称' },
      { prop: 'createTime', label: '创建时间' },
      { prop: 'status', label: '状态' }
    ]);

 // 搜索表单数据
    const searchForm = reactive({
      pageNum: 1,
      pageSize: 12,
    });

    const total = ref(0)


    // 查询列表数据
    const { data: listData, refetch } = useQuery({
      queryKey: ['list', searchForm],
      queryFn: () => fetchList(searchForm),
      onSuccess:({data})=>{
        const { result } = data || {};
        if (data?.success) {
          tableData.value = result.list
          total.value = result.total;
       }
      }
    });

   const onChange = (key, value) => {
      console.log(key, value);
      if (value) {
       form.value[key] = value;
      } else {
        delete form.value[key];
      }

      searchFn();
    };

    // 搜索
    const searchFn = () => {
      form.value = {
        pageNum: 1,
        pageSize: 12,
      };
      refetch();
    };

    // 重置
    const resetFn = () => {
      proxy.$refs.searchForm.resetFields();
      searchFn();
    };

    // 分页变化
    const handlePageChange = (current) => {
      page.current = current;
      refetch();
    };

    // 表格选择
    const handleSelectionChange = (selection) => {
      console.log('selected:', selection);
    };

    // 生命周期
    onMounted(() => {
      fetchList();
    });

    return {
      searchForm,
      tableData,
      loading,
      columns,
      page,
      searchFn,
      resetFn,
      handlePageChange,
      handleSelectionChange
    };
  }
};
</script>

<!-- 使用Tailwind CSS，无需额外的样式 -->
```
## Instructions for use

1. ** components are introduced **
- Ensure that vue is installed and configured
- Ensure that @tanstack/vue-query is installed and configured
- Introduce the required Element UI components
- Ensure that Tailwind CSS is installed and configured

2. ** Data management **
- Managing form data using reactive
- Use ref to manage reactive data
- Manage asynchronous data requests using useQuery

3. ** Style specification **
- Use the Tailwind CSS utility class
- Follow Tailwind's responsive design principles
- Customize using Tailwind's theme configuration

4. ** Best Practice **
- Organize code uniformly using the Composition API
- Rational use of computed and watch
- Unified error handling and loading status
- Implement the necessary permission control
- Use Tailwind's @apply instruction to extract duplicate style patterns

## Precautions

1. Notice the error when processing asynchronous requests
2. Optimize the cache performance
3. Pay attention to component lifecycle management
4. Keep your code style consistent
5. Organize the name of Tailwind reasonably to avoid being too long
6. Consider using Tailwind's @apply instruction to create reusable style components
